                            <div>
                                <strong>Google OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials:</strong>
                                Configure your OAuth credentials created under the active project email (<code>showsgarage@gmail.com</code>) via <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials" target="_blank" class="fw-bold text-decoration-underline">Google Cloud Console</a>.
